From 83e8cc668a0a50acd90fffd0561f967658c3a87f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 02:07:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] decklink: fixes from second review

- vo: free DR images released by the mirror worker before the VO uninit
- mirror: size the ring by the content rate with a fixed --decklink-mode
- mirror: estimate the rate of files without fps from frame timestamps
  (speed independent, tells 23.976 from 24)
- mirror: shrink the ring when its limit goes down
- mirror: repeat the oldest frame instead of black for late slots
- backends: skip slots that are already due in late callbacks
- audio: wait for the DeckLink latency before starting audio; keep the
  previous latency while the output restarts
- meson: depend on all DeckLink IDL files
